      "specialRules": [
        {
          "rulename": "Field of Scholarship",
          "ruleFull": "When the Scholar joins the warband, choose the field he has studied. A Ghutani Scholar may only take Poetry or Theology.\n\nCartography: add or subtract 1 from the D6 when exploring.\n\nPhysiology: after all serious injuries have been worked out, one hero may re-roll his result.\n\nPoetry: the warband's leader adds +1 to his Leadership for his first Leadership test of a scenario if the warband won its last battle. For one turn of a scenario, every friendly model within 6\" has +1 Weapon Skill and +1 Attack.\n\nTheology: the Scholar serves The One and learns Holy skills.\n\nThe Occult: the Scholar is a wizard and casts Lesser Magic."
        }
      ]
